WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Wartime planners needed air cover in the middle of the Atlantic.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Project Habbakuk investigated an enormous carrier made with reinforced ice.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A refrigerated model was built in Canada, but the full ship required much more.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Costs, engineering and better alternatives stopped the giant carrier.
